emale Beppo is hilarious lost  crew members are even in love talking  about how their Captain is so cute now  see what I'm saying not the most useful  crew right here by the way how crazy  would it be if disability was used on  Zorro and we saw sanji's reaction he'd  be so torn it would be hilarious anyways  they call it an infection and it spreads  to the other crew members as well as  mentioned they're doing the so-called  Forced Gender flipping because  Blackbeard is hoping it will disorient  law and his crew law is sweating so he  is nervous but he says it'll be fine and  his clashes with the Emperors taught him  that that devil fruit powers can be  countered if you use a great deal of  hockey again we have the theme of Hockey  being more important than fruit Powers  which I like otherwise a broken fruit  could lead to a cheap Victory which no  one wants that law succeeds in  nullifying the disease duck Q is the one  that used his six fruit to do it all he  calls that one the Milady transformation  plague and you can bet he has a lot more  of those plagues to come you can  definitely see why he'd be such a threat  to the World At Large and that also I'd  say deserves a huge Bounty then we see  van auger use a warp warp root to  teleport Burgess to the island where law  and his crew are another crazy fruit  power Burgess uses the buff buff fruit  to lift an entire Mountain he even calls  his fruit of the best since super  strength is already a thing with strong  characters you can only imagine how op  this fruit must be it has to amplify  physical strength way more or it  wouldn't even be a fruit thus Burgess  May well be the physically strongest  person in the series right now crazy how  much Oda is showing off the Blackbeard  Pirates here he's really hyping them up  this Arc so I'm hoping that this Arc  will have a consistent Blackbeard Focus  live in comments on how these guys have  hunted down some insane powers and how  it's no wonder their bounties keep  Ri