fice their life to Grant another  Eternal youth or life we're not totally  clear on how this will look yet but it  was mentioned before in the story so  chances are it will come into play  obviously Blackbeard would love this but  I also find it very hard to believe that  Oda would sacrifice law a very popular  character we'll see what happens but  Blackbeard in a sense as I'll explain  has definitely surpassed Shanks with  this I wouldn't go so far as to say that  Blackbeard has definitely surpassed  Shanks strength wise or that he could  beat him in a one-on-one fight because  Shanks has just been all flexing so far  but Bounty wise after the bowl attack  the Kobe kidnapping and now inevitably  taking down a dude with a bounty as high  as yonko Luffy's he will have to  Skyrocket especially if as lost says  their bounties are always going up  already I gotta say I was not expecting  such a good crazy chapter but I'm so  glad Oda over delivered here I was  thinking maybe we just get some  continuing events on Egghead but this  Blackbeard Insanity was amazing  especially since Blackbeard is like one  of my favorite antagonists ever so  getting such a hype chapter with him in  it was amazing definitely smash that  like button if you love this chapter  like me let me know your theories for  what will happen does anyone actually  think that law has a chance let me know  in the comments law can use his  Awakening but that makes me also wonder  what would Blackbeard's Awakening be has  he already awakened it or are we gonna  see something else crazy from his  awakened devil fruits so much to get  hyped about with this Cliffhanger make  this the video you subscribe if you  haven't already and hit that  notification Bell so you don't miss  future one piece videos and updates  while you wait for the next chapter to  drop feel free to check out my one piece  playlist that includes videos and all  the Admirals yonko an hour long video  about Shanks and much more link to that  